-- Classic 1.60: Tauren racial Cultivation (20552 -> 1312643): the duplicate ("cultivated") herb of every herb we spawn.
-- Official twins seen in the sniffs: Peacebloom 1618 -> 657382, Wilted Peacebloom 656160 -> 657454 (same name, model and loot as
-- the herb, lock 4522 = key spell 1312650, so no Herbalism skill is needed, Data17 = 158458 like theirs). The other herbs were not
-- sniffed: their twins are copies of the herb with the same two changes, entry 9700000 + herb (Stunted Silverleaf 656161 -> 9556161).
-- classic_spell_tauren_cultivate_herb finds a herb's twin by model + loot. Safe to run again.
